  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9704.02 Allowable Costs",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-07-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9704.02 Allowable Costs.\n\n(a) Grant funds shall reimburse grantees for 50% of the cost, up to a maximum of $50,000 per entity, for the following expenses:\n\n(1) Purchase of body-worn or dashboard cameras;\n\n(2) Ongoing software maintenance expenses of body-worn or dashboard cameras; or\n\n(3) Costs related to the maintenance and storage of data recorded by body-worn and dashboard cameras.\n\n(b) The unreimbursable portion of these purchases shall be funded from any locally available, non-grant funds.\n\nSource. #13338, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-28-22; ss by #13365, eff 4-18-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c9700.html"
